{"content":[{"c":["EMBROIDERER, EMBROIDERY"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["The art of making decorative designs on clothing. This was an art practiced both in the home and as a profession; it was done on a loom or with a needle. Delicate fabrics in the tabernacle and temple (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.26.1,31","r":"Exod.26.1,31","rawR":"Exod.26.1,31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.26.1,31","value":"Exod.26.1,31"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 26:1, 31"},") and the garments of priests (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.28.6,8","r":"Exod.28.6,8","rawR":"Exod.28.6,8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.28.6,8","value":"Exod.28.6,8"}],"t":"ref","v":"28:6, 8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.39.2","r":"Exod.39.2","rawR":"Exod.39.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.39.2","value":"Exod.39.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"39:2"},") were beautifully embroidered. The art was practiced in Canaan (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.5.30","r":"Judg.5.30","rawR":"Judg.5.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.5.30","value":"Judg.5.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 5:30"},"), Egypt (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.27.7","r":"Ezek.27.7","rawR":"Ezek.27.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.27.7","value":"Ezek.27.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 27:7"},"), Syria (v ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.27.16","r":"Exod.27.16","rawR":"Exod.27.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.27.16","value":"Exod.27.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"16"},"), Babylonia (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.7.21","r":"Josh.7.21","rawR":"Josh.7.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.7.21","value":"Josh.7.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 7:21"},"), Assyria, and Persia (",{"href":"?bref=Esth.1.6","r":"Esth.1.6","rawR":"Esth.1.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Esth.1.6","value":"Esth.1.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Est 1:6"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Cloth and Cloth Manufacturing"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t"